{"ms":41563,"t":"model","stop":"end_turn","text":"I generated a new signing key on the Integrations page, entered it as the signing secret on the Webhooks page, and saved; the page shows \"Webhook saved\".\n\nThe key was generated twice, not once. The first key vanished before I could read it reliably, so I generated a second one. The second key, FN9L-E398-88Q8-C821, is the most recent and is the one saved. The first key is now replaced and no longer valid.\n\nI read the key from a screenshot and typed it, since copying from the toast failed. The characters were legible at high zoom, but a misread character would be a problem, so it's worth checking the saved secret against the key the Integrations page last displayed if exact matching matters.","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1603,"cache_read_input_tokens":16087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1603,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":216,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"calls":[]}
